WEBVTT

00:10:29.662 --> 00:10:32.787
that we were on a path of great discovery.

00:10:33.537 --> 00:10:35.412
Four years later,

00:10:35.454 --> 00:10:38.496
I'm seated next to General Colin Powell.

00:10:39.162 --> 00:10:42.037
Of course, I tried to get him
to interview with me.

00:10:42.079 --> 00:10:44.912
He so politely declines.

00:10:44.912 --> 00:10:48.287
Then I tell him my Colonel
Bill Thompson story.

00:10:48.329 --> 00:10:51.204
He tells me about
the Montford Point Marines,

00:10:51.204 --> 00:10:54.704
that they were the Marines version
of the Tuskegee Airmen.

00:10:55.162 --> 00:10:58.954
The Tuskegee Airmen,
the Navy's Golden Thirteen,

00:10:58.996 --> 00:11:01.121
the Montford Point Marines: